{"3900980": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Apocalypse Truck Simulator", "steam_appid": 3900980, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WAKE UP, TIME TO DRIVE!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Apocalypse has reduced the world to a collection of small rocky outcrops scattered in The Toxic Sea. Known as The Remnant States, survivors cling to these islands in makeshift settlements in desperate of resources. As an elite driver for the 'Insane Jane Transport' company (IJT) you can help reshape the future of Humanity and help the settlers rebuild their communities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REALISTIC PHYSICS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Apocalypse Truck Simulator</strong> is a Top Down off-road truck driving challenge featuring realistic physics and an unique post apocalyptic world. The focus is on providing a harsh terrain driving experience without requiring endless hours of grinding and economic management to get to the good stuff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900980/extras/5ec2177304a5fd4ccb197d5229933a1c.poster.avif?t=1770871023\" aria-label=\"Truck drives on harsh terrain\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900980/extras/5ec2177304a5fd4ccb197d5229933a1c.webm?t=1770871023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900980/extras/5ec2177304a5fd4ccb197d5229933a1c.mp4?t=1770871023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BONUS LEVELS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through the main missions bonus levels become available, giving access to new challenges and vehicles, giving the Player the opportunity to experience the world of The Remnant States from differing perspectives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900980/extras/a05a978e3072ecd0722e9b3e8df103c8.poster.avif?t=1770871023\" aria-label=\"Wild R.V. jumps water\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900980/extras/a05a978e3072ecd0722e9b3e8df103c8.webm?t=1770871023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900980/extras/a05a978e3072ecd0722e9b3e8df103c8.mp4?t=1770871023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >POST APOCALYPTIC WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of <strong>Apocalypse Truck Simulator</strong> has been inspired by the unforgiving and desolate Australian wilderness, and also features a bespoke soundtrack that reflects the realities and hopes of an actual apocalypse survivor...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CASUAL EXPERIENCE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Apocalypse Truck Simulator</strong> is a game designed for modern sensibilities while featuring an old school emphasis on a simple, enjoyable experience, making it perfect for casual play. </p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WAKE UP, TIME TO DRIVE!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Apocalypse has reduced the world to a collection of small rocky outcrops scattered in The Toxic Sea. Known as The Remnant States, survivors cling to these islands in makeshift settlements in desperate of resources. As an elite driver for the 'Insane Jane Transport' company (IJT) you can help reshape the future of Humanity and help the settlers rebuild their communities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REALISTIC PHYSICS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Apocalypse Truck Simulator</strong> is a Top Down off-road truck driving challenge featuring realistic physics and an unique post apocalyptic world. The focus is on providing a harsh terrain driving experience without requiring endless hours of grinding and economic management to get to the good stuff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900980/extras/5ec2177304a5fd4ccb197d5229933a1c.poster.avif?t=1770871023\" aria-label=\"Truck drives on harsh terrain\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900980/extras/5ec2177304a5fd4ccb197d5229933a1c.webm?t=1770871023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900980/extras/5ec2177304a5fd4ccb197d5229933a1c.mp4?t=1770871023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BONUS LEVELS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through the main missions bonus levels become available, giving access to new challenges and vehicles, giving the Player the opportunity to experience the world of The Remnant States from differing perspectives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900980/extras/a05a978e3072ecd0722e9b3e8df103c8.poster.avif?t=1770871023\" aria-label=\"Wild R.V. jumps water\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900980/extras/a05a978e3072ecd0722e9b3e8df103c8.webm?t=1770871023\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900980/extras/a05a978e3072ecd0722e9b3e8df103c8.mp4?t=1770871023\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >POST APOCALYPTIC WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of <strong>Apocalypse Truck Simulator</strong> has been inspired by the unforgiving and desolate Australian wilderness, and also features a bespoke soundtrack that reflects the realities and hopes of an actual apocalypse survivor...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CASUAL EXPERIENCE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Apocalypse Truck Simulator</strong> is a game designed for modern sensibilities while featuring an old school emphasis on a simple, enjoyable experience, making it perfect for casual play. </p>", "short_description": "Take control of powerful, all terrain vehicles and deliver various cargoes across a challenging, broken, post apocalyptic world.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900980/af84d019802d490a99a3dbd3c56ba4ef9456e31f/header.jpg?t=1770871023", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900980/24f120b407434955e46fa7498a429d53672cc999/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770871023", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3900980/24f120b407434955e46fa7498a429d53672cc999/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770871023", "website": "http://festivalofdelusion.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 or AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 6GB or AMD Radeon RX 590 8GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 23 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Controller recommended</li>